====== TP-Link TL-WA901ND ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

The TL-WA901ND is a lowcost b/g/n wireless access point, capable of running OpenWrt. 

